# Local values for the Worker under `pnpm dev` and `pnpm preview`. Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored),
# uncomment what you need, and restart the server. Every value is optional; `pnpm test:e2e` ignores this file.

# GitHub sign-in (publishing, Community listing, Cloud sync). Without both, local projects and runs still work,
# and existing shares remain readable, but sign-in answers 503.
# Create your own dev GitHub App; register http://127.0.0.1:4173/api/auth/github/callback
# (use your server's actual origin). See docs/cloudflare.md#sign-in-with-github.
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=Iv23li...
# GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=...

# AI chat relay: messages forwarded per UTC day across all rooms (wrangler.jsonc sets 400000). A low value such as
# 50 shows the daily limit after a reply or two.
# CONNECT_DAILY_MESSAGES=50

# GITHUB_OAUTH_URL and GITHUB_API_URL point sign-in at a mock GitHub. Only the e2e server sets them; leave them unset.
